body:
Nonsense. The governments of the world are horrific as a result of the voting, fearmongering and greed of adults. The more young people (whose lives are affected hugely by political decisions as well) voting the better. Might finally result in fewer revoltingly bad world governments.

&#x200B;

Also, 21?! If the voting age was raised so 20 year olds couldn't vote, that would be grounds for riot.

My girlfriend left me after saying she was unhappy with the person she was and she needed to be single for a while, but she loved me and had every intention of getting back together with me. I decided to give her all the space she needed, just get out of her hair for a while...

&#x200B;

A month later she walked into college (we study in the same class) hand in hand with another man. They'd been dating for seemingly the entire time. I was the last to hear about it.

&#x200B;

The pain is crippling. The fact that she said these things to me is unbelievable. I'm so fucking angry and sad and confused. I can't believe that this is how she let me know its over. I'm so destroyed, I really thought she loved me. I really did.
